:''Not to be confused with [[Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Lilin]].''
'''Lilith Cat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Halloween Capsules (Gacha Event)|Halloween Capsules gacha event]]. This unit is an [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel]] variant of [[Ice Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Ice Cat]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]] increases damage, extends range, and also targets [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]].

