==Trivia==
*[[wikipedia:Lilith|Lilith]] is a figure in Jewish mythology, commonly portrayed as a succubus.
**Queen Succubus Cat's [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]] alongside [[Marquis Clionius]], an enemy whose Japanese name and demonic children may also reference Lilith, and [[Pipette of Passion]], a stage seemingly designed for Talented Queen Succubus Cat.
*The hockey-masked cat beside Queen Succubus Cat is a reference to [[wikipedia:Jason Voorhees|Jason Voorhees]].
*The word 小悪魔 ''koakuma'' in Succubus Cat's Japanese description literally translates to "little devil", but can also refer to an attractive young woman who seduces and toys with men.
*Queen Succubus Cat has yellow eyes like many of the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]], albeit a lighter yellow.
*She is the first seasonal [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] to gain a [[True Form]].
*She is the first unit that requires an Aku [[Catfruit]] to evolve.
*There is a typo in her Normal Form's English description: it says "...to a more '''mischevious'''" instead of "...to a more '''mischievous'''"

